    "OptionFaction2Points": 100,
    "DialogText": "Some properties do much more than give you ownership of a building.

Certain professions require you to own the appropriate workplace before you can access the job.

Examples include:

- Farms for farming professions
- Garages for mechanics
- Dealerships for automobile businesses
- Fishing Huts for fishermen
- Domains for some higher-level professions and activities

These properties are part of the profession itself. Buying the correct region can therefore unlock new economic opportunities that aren't available through ordinary Starter Jobs.

If you're looking for one of these workplaces, you can use:

`!region lookFor <type>`

For example, `!region lookFor Farm` or `!region lookFor Garage` will show the matching properties currently available for purchase and their prices.

If you're interested in one of these careers, make sure you understand the property requirements before making your investment.",
